  "worked_solution": "Multiplying each row in the first matrix by each column in the second, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}ST & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 13 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1\\cdot (-3)+13\\cdot 1 & 1\\cdot 0+13\\cdot 2 \\\\ 1\\cdot (-3)+0\\cdot 1 & 1\\cdot 0+0\\cdot 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3+13 & 0+26 \\\\ -3+0 & 0+0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}10 & 26 \\\\ -3 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
